  "query_preview": "(Monday through Thursday)...\nThe coast and valleys will warm on Monday with winds for the\ndeserts becoming northwesterly. For Tuesday through Thursday, high\ntemperatures for inland areas will warm. High temperatures on\nThursday will be within a few degrees of average for the coast and\nvalleys and around 4 to 8 degrees above average for the deserts\nand lower elevations of the mountains. High temperatures for\nThursday of next week will range from around 70 near the coast to\nthe upper 70s to mid 80s for the Inland Empire with the upper 90s\nto 102 for the lower deserts.",
